# Optional. Leave unset in development: requests go to /api/mealplan and
# /api/ingredients, which the Vite dev server proxies to the local APIs.
#
# Set these for deployed environments. Neither API supports this yet:
# - Both APIs must enable CORS for the UI's origin (the MealPlan API with
#   credentials allowed).
# - The MealPlan API's sign-in cookie is SameSite=Lax, so the browser only sends
#   it when the UI and that API share a site (for example app.example.com and
#   api.example.com). On unrelated domains sign-in succeeds but every later
#   request answers 401; serve both behind one origin instead.
# VITE_MEALPLAN_API_URL=https://mealplan.example.com
# VITE_INGREDIENTS_API_URL=https://ingredients.example.com
